<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cellegy restarted as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cellegy restarted as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- National Securities Corp said Friday it restarted coverage of Cellegy Pharmaceuticals Inc with a buy recommendation.</p>
<p>-- Its EPS estimates for the pharmaceutical company are for a loss of $0.27 in FY97 and profit of $0.23 in FY98. Cellegy posted a loss of $0.73 per share in fiscal 1996.</p>
<p>-- National Securities' price target on the stock is $10 to $12.</p>
<p>-- Cellegy was trading at 4-7/8, up 1/8.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
